JetFormer PyTorch
Copyright 2025-2026 JetFormer Contributors

This distribution includes a PyTorch reimplementation derived in part from
Google's Big Vision project: its JET and JetFormer models together with the
Gemma decoder, Vision Transformer, and GIVT mixture-head components they build
on. The upstream sources are at:

  https://github.com/google-research/big_vision

